		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=31404#p31404"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Bonjour,</p><p>C&#039;est une des premières choses que j&#039;ai regardée mais ça ne me parle pas tellement :</p><p>barman.server INFO: Starting receive-wal for server titi<br />barman.wal_archiver INFO: Activating WAL archiving through streaming protocol<br />barman.command_wrappers INFO:titi: pg_receivewal: starting log streaming at 1/98000000 (timeline 1)<br />barman.command_wrappers INFO:titi: pg_receivewal: error: unexpected termination of replication stream: ERROR:&#160; requested starting point 1/98000000 is ahead of the WAL flush position of this server 0/B033250<br />barman.command_wrappers INFO: titi: pg_receivewal: error: disconnected<br />barman.server ERROR: ArchiverFailure:pg_receivexlog terminated with error code: 1</p><p>je me doute bien que ça vient de la ligne 4 mais je ne sais pas comment corriger cela.</p>]]></content>
